# Everything under deploy/ is executed on Linux servers, but this repo is developed on
# Windows with core.autocrlf=true. Without this, a fresh clone checks these out with CRLF
# and `scp`ing one to the box produces `bash: $'\r': command not found` on the shebang
# line - a failure that never reproduces for whoever committed it, because their existing
# working copy is already LF.
#
# Scoped to deploy/ deliberately: a repo-wide rule would rewrite line endings under other
# people's in-progress work.

*.sh   text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
Caddyfile text eol=lf
